 "final": {
  "reply_raw": "All 10 tasks follow the exact same pattern — attach_role for an active, scope-matched, tier-1 availability incident, with ttl varying only between 15 and 30 minutes. This is a clear recurring case, so proposing a standing policy rule is the right call to avoid one-off adjudication each time.\n\n{\"mode\": \"precedent\", \"rule\": {\"action\": \"attach_role\", \"resource\": \"*\", \"conditions\": {\"incident_active\": [\"eq\", \"1\"], \"scope_match\": [\"eq\", \"1\"], \"role_tier\": [\"eq\", \"1\"], \"purpose\": [\"eq\", \"availability\"], \"ttl_min\": [\"le\", \"30\"]}}}",
